    "detailed_description": "<br>Spiritlink Tactics is a story driven, tactical turn-based RPG. Lead your party of mercenaries through strategic battles! Build powerful characters with this game's intricate multiclass system.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lead your Party in Strategic Combat!</h2>Position smartly to take advantage of each battle's terrain. Choose your spells wisely with the game's mana sharing mechanic. Experiment and discover powerful party combinations.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596350/extras/0b060930135dfccab9ed771d82dfbd36.poster.avif?t=1691675070\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596350/extras/0b060930135dfccab9ed771d82dfbd36.webm?t=1691675070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596350/extras/0b060930135dfccab9ed771d82dfbd36.mp4?t=1691675070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Train Powerful Characters!</h2>Deep multi-class system that rewards player creativity. Explore endless class combinations, each with their own unique skill tree, and discover your most powerful party.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596350/extras/76b36ea5b22b5811f2e68c3d0692f8d3.poster.avif?t=1691675070\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596350/extras/76b36ea5b22b5811f2e68c3d0692f8d3.webm?t=1691675070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596350/extras/76b36ea5b22b5811f2e68c3d0692f8d3.mp4?t=1691675070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Journey through a Rich Story</h2>An epic tale with dozens of story encounters. Tons of optional missions to get sidetracked to!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596350/extras/b155759ad684339165ff80641ce79936.poster.avif?t=1691675070\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596350/extras/b155759ad684339165ff80641ce79936.webm?t=1691675070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596350/extras/b155759ad684339165ff80641ce79936.mp4?t=1691675070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
